    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I don't have the logic specs handy, the execs just gave me the high-level summary. basically they want to move away from heavy centralized computing to save money. just use your current predictive modeling to estimate the difference. if the rule-based system is less 'intelligent' than you, just give me a rough idea of how much that might mess with our reliability or fuel costs. is it gonna be a big drop-off?",
